// Spiral Pierce (LK_SPIRALPIERCE): five spear thrusts dive into the target from
// alternating sides, each landing with a glow and a cross glint, over a steady cool glow.
// The reference only plays sounds; this is an approximation. Also reused by
// Shield Chain. ~0.9s.
// Coordinates follow inc_agi.strfx.ron: (319, 291) is the anchor's feet, smaller
// y is higher, 1024 angle units per turn. Soft billboard textures only: the
// ring_*/lens_* bands are cylinder wraps and read as boxes when drawn flat.
